# profiler, the scrolling plot of a data file: Meta-O (Alt) opens the library's file dialog, the typed path of pf.txt (300 numbers beside it
# in the package, the dialog's field holding 50 characters) and Return (Okay) load it, the data is plotted in its strip, its End of data
# notice is closed with Return with the pointer on it, and Meta-Q ends the program by itself
move 238 127
keydown Alt_L
key o
keyup Alt_L
wait
type /home/corpus/packages/icon/ipl_gprogs/pf.txt
key Return
wait
move 230 150
key Return
wait
move 238 127
keydown Alt_L
key q
keyup Alt_L
